type: software
title: "ASB Schema: LinkML schemas for the ASB standard"
abstract: >-
  LinkML schemas for machine-readable scientific tasks extracted from
  published research: task cards, capsules, skill bundles, skill collections
  and the collection registry, with generated JSON Schema files and a JSON-LD
  context.
